      "comment": "Huitzilin: Battle of the Seven Colors",
      "content": "In the Battle of the Seven Colors, Huitzilin turned colour into a maze of memories that trapped Abyssal forces: without the capacity for memory, they could not find their way across. The tribe won. Chief Biram believes a scroll depicting the battle was her own work. The Seven-Hued Ruins preserve a space of this kind, with a trace of her consciousness in it.",
